{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, move to it, grab it and check battery. If not, explore area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = CheckBattery    /> <Action ID = ExploreArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsAreaExplored    />\"",
